OL,3,GNEWSAAn arrest, a defection and a new
OL,4,Aleader - how Reform's 'challenging'
OL,5,Aweek unfolded
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It's been challenging but we've come
OL,8,Fthrough it," said Reform's chief whip
OL,9,Fin the Senedd, LlE7r Powell, as he
OL,10,Freflected on the past seven days.
OL,12,FThe week began with the party's leader
OL,13,Fin Wales being arrested on suspicion of
OL,14,Fassault and controlling or coercive
OL,15,Fbehaviour.
OL,17,FDan Thomas said he had been "released
OL,18,Fwithout charge" and had "done nothing
OL,19,Fwrong".
